509
00:22:38,724 --> 00:22:40,692
Jack Ross at your service.

510
00:22:40,692 --> 00:22:44,196
I'm Rose MacClare,
 how do you do?

511
00:22:44,196 --> 00:22:47,833
Rose, I've been sent
 to fetch you.

512
00:22:49,868 --> 00:22:51,670
BRUCE:
 Despite their privilege,

513
00:22:51,670 --> 00:22:54,773
