516
00:23:01,313 --> 00:23:02,781
Did you miss me?

517
00:23:02,781 --> 00:23:04,483
Of course.

518
00:23:06,118 --> 00:23:07,953
Is it really only a week
 until you leave?

519
00:23:07,953 --> 00:23:08,954
Mmm.

520
00:23:08,954 --> 00:23:11,423
You know,
 she was practically naked.

521
00:23:11,423 --> 00:23:12,457
Oh, my darling.

522
00:23:17,462 --> 00:23:19,965
That is the evening
