876
00:38:04,749 --> 00:38:08,953
you're not getting the same
 amount of oxygen to your brain

877
00:38:08,953 --> 00:38:10,788
that you would normally.

878
00:38:10,788 --> 00:38:14,025
So it creates
 a very passive personality.

879
00:38:14,025 --> 00:38:15,893
Golly,
 my corset's tight.

880
00:38:15,893 --> 00:38:17,128
Anna, when you've
 done that,

881
00:38:17,128 --> 00:38:19,130
would you be an angel
 and loosen it a bit?

882
00:38:19,130 --> 00:38:21,365
The start
 of the slippery slope.

883
00:38:22,900 --> 00:38:24,902
CREW:
 Sound, speed.

884
00:38:24,902 --> 00:38:26,971
McGOVERN:
 It isn't so applicable now

885
00:38:26,971 --> 00:38:29,407
because we're now in 1924

886
00:38:29,407 --> 00:38:31,642
and the clothes were giving us
 much more license

887
00:38:31,642 --> 00:38:36,514
to freely move, think, talk,
 eat, do everything.

888
00:38:36,514 --> 00:38:39,750
And I don't think
 it's a coincidence

889
00:38:39,750 --> 00:38:42,320
that women were
 suddenly demanding

890
00:38:42,320 --> 00:38:45,956
to have their opinions heard

891
00:38:45,956 --> 00:38:50,728
and demanding to find a use
