945
00:40:59,523 --> 00:41:00,858
(laughing)

946
00:41:00,858 --> 00:41:02,193
CREW:
 Here we go, rehearsal.

947
00:41:02,193 --> 00:41:04,829
BRUCE:
 People wore hats in this time,

